# Single source of truth for the Splice release this project builds against.
#
# Every Splice DAR version (splice-amulet, splice-util, the token-standard APIs,
# the splice-amulet-test harness) is DERIVED from this tag: scripts/fetch-dep.sh
# reads each version out of the vendored source tree and exposes it to daml.yaml
# through stable-name symlinks. Do NOT pin individual DAR versions here or in
# daml.yaml. To move to a new Splice release, change ONLY this line, then run
# `npm run setup`. (The SDK/LF pins live in every tracked daml.yaml; if a new tag
# ships a different SDK, update sdk-version there too - see AGENTS.md.)
SPLICE_TAG=0.6.7
